# Molten Exhale's own "as though it had flash if you behold a Dragon" applies to every cast of it, flashback included (CR
# 601.2b, 702.34a, 701.4a): flashback changes where it is cast from and what it costs, not when. Bot2's Duress takes the Exhale
# from Bot1's hand. On turn 4 Bot2 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot1; Bot1 flashes in Snapcaster Mage over it, gives the Exhale
# flashback (its {1}{R}), and casts it from the graveyard with the Bolt still on the stack, beholding the Phyrexian Dragon Engine
# it controls, unasked about the extra. It kills Bot2's Ornithopter and is exiled; the Bolt then takes Bot1 to 17.

